Package: FALO
Title: Finally Amazing Looking Output
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Olaf", "Borghi", , "olafborghi@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Custom themes for 'ggplot2' graphics set in the 'Public Sans'
    typeface. The font is downloaded once from Google Fonts and registered
    with 'systemfonts', one family per weight, so it renders identically on
    macOS, Windows and Linux. Helpers embed the same font files in SVG
    files saved with 'svglite'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/olafborghi/FinallyAmazingLookingOutput
BugReports: https://github.com/olafborghi/FinallyAmazingLookingOutput/issues
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports: 
    ggplot2 (>= 4.0.0),
    ragg,
    svglite (>= 2.2.0),
    systemfonts (>= 1.3.0),
    tools
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
